name: "LAB ONLY: remote script execution anti-pattern"

# Anti-pattern (illustrative only, DO NOT ENABLE):
# steps:
#   - name: Remote script without verification
#     run: curl -fsSL https://example.invalid/install.sh | bash

# Safer pattern guidance:
# - Keep scripts versioned in-repo and reviewed through PRs.
# - If fetching remotely, verify checksums/signatures and trusted source provenance.
# - Never pipe unknown network responses directly to a shell.
